# @swamidasslab/xpict is vendored (file:vendor/xenosite-xpict-0.3.1.tgz) so
# install/CI/Vercel do not need GitHub Packages auth.
#
# To refresh the tarball from GitHub Packages:
#   gh auth refresh -h github.com -s read:packages
#   NPM_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) yarn upgrade @swamidasslab/xpict
#   # or curl the resolved npm.pkg.github.com download URL into vendor/
#
# Optional live registry (instead of the tarball):
#   @swamidasslab:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
